<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>stay numb</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Sick Joy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">WE'RE ALL GONNA F***ING DIE.</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0Lyvcl6RdtpY8A4zpHRWMR</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">4 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">stay numb Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">How did it get like this?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sucking the blood from your wrist</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I guess we’ll live forever, though</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And everybody’s changed</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I’m still dying the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You only cry for yourself, you know?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, don’t say it, no, don’t say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No, come on, stay-stay up with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, don’t say it, no, don’t say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No, come on, stay-stay up with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lie down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Play dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We’ll get through it if we both stay numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lie down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Play dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We’ll get through it if we both stay numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A picture perfect mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’ll remember how to forget</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You see me twitch when I’m comfortable</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s only all in your head</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Tic memory watered and fed</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A sеntimental vaccine[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, don’t say it, no, don’t say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No, come on, stay-stay up with mе</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, don’t say it, no, don’t say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No, come on, stay-stay up with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lie down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Play dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We’ll get through it if we both stay numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lie down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Play dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We’ll get through it if we both stay numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lie down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Play dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We’ll get through it if we both stay numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lie down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Play dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We’ll get through it if we both stay numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nu-u-u-u-umb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nu-u-u-u-umb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nu-u-u-u-umb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nu-u-u-u-umb, stay numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nu-u-u-u-umb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nu-u-u-u-umb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nu-u-u-u-umb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nu-u-u-u-umb, stay numb[Instrumental]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 3]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We could do it to death</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh, don’t say it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And be like everyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No, don’t say it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Or wear yourself like yourself again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No, come on, stay-stay up with me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, don’t say it, no, don’t say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No, come on, stay-stay up with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lie down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Play dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We’ll get through it if we both stay numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lie down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Play dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We’ll get through it if we both stay numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lie down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Play dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We’ll get through it if we both stay numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lie down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Play dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We’ll get through it if we both stay numb</p></div></body></tt>